# Audio Files Directory

Place your wedding music files here:

1. invitation-music.mp3 - Soft, elegant music for the invitation screen
2. wedding-music.mp3 - Celebratory, romantic music for the main site

Recommended audio formats:
- MP3 (recommended for compatibility)
- OGG (alternative format)
- WAV (high quality, larger file size)

Audio tips:
- Keep files under 5MB for faster loading
- Use royalty-free music or obtain proper licenses
- Test audio levels - not too loud, not too quiet
- Consider looping seamless tracks
